#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD9722 expect=skipped domain=EC
#note "Neither ECDOSE nor ECDOSTXT is in the dataset: Requirements.Variables.All [ECDOSE] is unsatisfied, so the sister skips naming ECDOSE. Deliberate: the all-absent dose-description shape is owned by the CDISC-CG0100-A family (fires only when all four of ECDOSE/ECDOSTXT/ECSTAT/ECOCCUR are absent, Source subject ECDOSE), so All: [ECDOSE] hands that case over and loses nothing."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset EC class=INTERVENTIONS label="Exposure as Collected"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ECSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col ECTRT   type=Char label="Name of Treatment"
col ECOCCUR type=Char label="Occurrence"
---
S1 | EC | 001 | 1 | DRUG A | Y
